  <main class="page page--wide">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 · Prefill 启动桥接</p>
      <h1>先由 Target 为真实 prompt 建立语义，再把 Target auxiliary hidden 投影成 Draft KV</h1>
      <p class="lead"><code>DSparkWorkerV2._forward_prefill()</code> 同时完成三件事：让 Target 正常 prefill 并采出首个 token <code>X</code>；把 prompt 输入行的 FULL auxiliary hidden 注入 Draft KV；把 <code>X@20</code> 封装为下一轮 Draft anchor。<code>X</code> 此刻还没有自己的 hidden/KV。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>运行时接收者</strong> <code>scheduler.model_worker : DSparkWorkerV2</code> → <code>self.target_worker : TpModelWorker</code></span><span><strong>固定例子</strong> 单请求 · <code>prefix_lens=[0]</code> · <code>extend_lens=[20]</code> · <code>seq_lens=[20]</code></span><span><strong>后端假设</strong> CUDA dSpark V2 · PP=1；MLX/NPU/XPU 覆盖路径不由本页推断</span></div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="选择后续 decode 路线"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>

    <section class="handoff" aria-label="Prefill 启动交接契约">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入</b><span><code>batch_to_run : ScheduleBatch</code>，<code>forward_mode=EXTEND/MIXED</code>，含 <code>extend_lens/prefix_lens/out_cache_loc</code></span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>关键捕获</b><span><code>capture_hidden_mode=CaptureHiddenMode.FULL</code>，必须得到 Target auxiliary hidden</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>状态变化</b><span>Draft KV 写入 prompt/extend 输入行；大 <code>hidden_states</code> 随后清空引用</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span><code>GenerationBatchResult(next_draft_input=DFlashDraftInputV2(bonus_tokens=[X],new_seq_lens=[20]))</code></span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="bootstrap-call-flow">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 启动桥接调用泳道</p><h2><code>DSparkWorkerV2 → TpModelWorker → ModelRunner → Target backend → KV injector → Draft KV</code></h2><p class="section__intro">每条泳道标明实例与具体类；紫色表示模型/设备执行，蓝色表示 tensor/object 交接。三条站点 route 在 Prefill 阶段共用此流程，差异从后续 decode 才出现。</p></div>
      <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="9">
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>正常 extend · 非 DP-idle 分支</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#bootstrap-board">放大主图</button></div>
        <div class="visual__body">
          <div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status aria-live="polite"></div></div>
          <div class="step-copyline" aria-live="polite"><div data-step-copy="0"><b>第 1 步 · 分派</b> <code>forward_mode.is_extend() || is_extend_in_batch</code> 命中，planner/observer 记录非 decode，然后进入 <code>_forward_prefill()</code>。</div><div data-step-copy="1"><b>第 2 步 · 构造 Target ForwardBatch</b> <code>TpModelWorker</code> 以 <code>CaptureHiddenMode.FULL</code> 调用 <code>ForwardBatch.init_new()</code>。</div><div data-step-copy="2"><b>第 3 步 · runner 分支</b> <code>ModelRunner._forward_raw()</code> 在 split prefill、prefill CUDA graph、eager extend 中选一条。</div><div data-step-copy="3"><b>第 4 步 · metadata / attention</b> 当前 runner 在需要时初始化 backend metadata，并执行 Target 模型；输出 logits 与 FULL auxiliary hidden。</div><div data-step-copy="4"><b>第 5 步 · 采样 X</b> <code>TpModelWorker</code> 用 Target logits 采样 <code>X</code> 并构造 <code>GenerationBatchResult</code>。</div><div data-step-copy="5"><b>第 6 步 · 发布长度</b> 设置 <code>new_seq_lens=batch.seq_lens=[20]</code>；overlap 在这里提前调用 <code>on_publish()</code>。</div><div data-step-copy="6"><b>第 7 步 · 注入 prompt hidden</b> 校验 hidden/extend/prefix/cache loc，计算 prompt 输入位置，再把 Target auxiliary hidden 投影写入 Draft KV。</div><div data-step-copy="7"><b>第 8 步 · 释放大引用</b> 注入完成后立即 <code>logits_output.hidden_states=None</code>，避免结果对象把整块 tensor 带回 Scheduler。</div><div data-step-copy="8"><b>第 9 步 · 首个滚动锚点</b> <code>make_next_draft_input()</code> 保存 <code>bonus_tokens=[X]</code> 与 <code>new_seq_lens=[20]</code>，下一轮 Draft 读取。</div></div>
          <div class="swim-scroll" id="bootstrap-board"><div class="bootstrap-board" role="table" aria-label="dSpark Prefill 启动桥接调用泳道">
            <div class="boot-head" role="row"><div class="boot-head__corner">阶段</div><div><span class="instance">self : DSparkWorkerV2</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.speculative.dspark_components.dspark_worker_v2.DSparkWorkerV2</span></div><div><span class="instance">target_worker : TpModelWorker</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.managers.tp_worker.TpModelWorker</span></div><div><span class="instance">target_model_runner : ModelRunner</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.model_executor.model_runner.ModelRunner</span></div><div><span class="instance">attn_backend : AttentionBackend</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.layers.attention.base_attn_backend.AttentionBackend</span></div><div><span class="instance">self._kv_injector : TargetHiddenKvInjector</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.speculative.dspark_components.dspark_kv_inject.TargetHiddenKvInjector</span></div><div><span class="instance">draft_kv_pool : BaseTokenToKVPool</span><span class="fqcn">self.draft_model_runner.token_to_kv_pool</span></div><div><span class="instance">batch_output : GenerationBatchResult</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.managers.utils.GenerationBatchResult</span></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="0"><div class="boot-time">T0<br>dispatch</div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow"><b>forward_batch_generation(batch,on_publish)</b><code>is_extend() || is_extend_in_batch</code> → note non-decode/prefill → <code>_forward_prefill()</code></div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="1"><div class="boot-time">T1<br>package</div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow"><b>target_worker.forward_batch_generation()</b><code>capture_hidden_mode=FULL</code></div></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow" data-kind="data"><b>ForwardBatch.init_new(batch,...)</b>把 <code>ScheduleBatch</code> 装配为 Target <code>ForwardBatch</code>。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="2"><div class="boot-time">T2<br>runner</div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow"><b>self.model_runner.forward(forward_batch)</b></div></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="guard"><b>ModelRunner._forward_raw()</b>split prefill | prefill CUDA graph | eager extend；先做 live-batch padding/normalization。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="3"><div class="boot-time">T3<br>Target forward</div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow" data-kind="cuda"><b>selected runner.execute()</b><code>model.forward(input_ids,positions,forward_batch)</code>；要求返回 FULL auxiliary hidden。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>init_forward_metadata() / attention</b>由具体 runner 与 <code>needs_forward_metadata_init()</code> 决定初始化位置。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="4"><div class="boot-time">T4<br>sample</div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow"><b>model_runner.sample(logits_output,forward_batch)</b>正常 prefill 不是 <code>is_verify=True</code>，所以采样首个 token <code>X</code>。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="return"><b>Target 输出</b><code>next_token_logits</code> + <code>hidden_states[20,H_aux]</code></div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="data"><b>GenerationBatchResult</b><code>next_token_ids=[X]</code><br><code>logits_output.hidden_states=H_prompt</code></div></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="5"><div class="boot-time">T5<br>publish</div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="guard"><b>new_seq_lens=batch.seq_lens</b><code>[20]</code>；overlap 时立即 <code>on_publish([20])</code>，non-overlap 仅写结果对象。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="data"><b>batch_output.new_seq_lens=[20]</b>注意：采出的 <code>X</code> 还没成为输入 KV，所以长度仍是 20。</div></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="6"><div class="boot-time">T6<br>inject</div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow"><b>compute_position(prefix_lens,extend_lens)</b>校验 FULL hidden、长度字段与 <code>out_cache_loc</code> 后调用 injector。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow" data-kind="data"><b>inject_target_hidden()</b><code>target_hidden=H_prompt</code><br><code>cache_loc=batch.out_cache_loc</code><br><code>positions=0..19</code></div></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="data"><b>write_target_hidden_kv()</b>只写 prompt/extend 输入行的 Draft K/V；标准池与 MLA/SWA 池内部实现不同，契约相同。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="7"><div class="boot-time">T7<br>release</div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="data"><b>logits_output.hidden_states=None</b>注入完成后解除结果对象对大 tensor 的持有。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="return"><b>保留 logits/next token</b>只清 FULL hidden 引用，不丢失已采样的 <code>X</code>。</div></div></div>
            <div class="boot-row" data-step-node="8"><div class="boot-time">T8<br>wrap / return</div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event boot-arrow"><b>make_next_draft_input()</b><code>bonus_tokens=[X]</code><br><code>new_seq_lens=[20]</code></div></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="data"><b>下一轮 Draft KV</b>已有 prompt positions <code>0..19</code>；位置 20 尚未写。</div></div><div class="boot-cell"><div class="boot-event" data-kind="return"><b>return batch_output</b><code>next_draft_input=DFlashDraftInputV2(X,[20])</code></div></div></div>
          </div></div>
          <div class="canvas-scroll"><div class="runner-branches" aria-label="Target Prefill runner 分支"><div class="runner-branch" data-kind="guard"><b>Split Prefill</b><span><code>forward_mode.is_split_prefill()</code> → <code>ModelRunner.forward_split_prefill()</code>；不进入 eager runner。启用 pDMux 时，Scheduler 还可能更早直接调用 <code>TpModelWorker.forward_batch_split_prefill()</code>，不经过本页的 dSpark owner 主链。</span></div><div class="runner-branch"><b>Prefill CUDA Graph</b><span>extend + runner 存在 + <code>can_run_graph()</code> + 无 CP strategy → <code>PrefillCudaGraphRunner.execute()</code>。</span></div><div class="runner-branch"><b>Eager Extend</b><span><code>EagerRunner.execute() → _execute_extend()</code>；若 <code>ForwardBatch.needs_forward_metadata_init()</code>，在此调用 <code>attn_backend.init_forward_metadata()</code>。</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="branch-note"><strong>DP-idle 边界：</strong><code>batch.forward_mode.is_idle()</code> 时，只有启用 DP attention 才让 Target worker 做参与式 FULL-hidden forward，随后直接返回 <code>_decode_idle_result()</code>；不会执行正常请求的 hidden 校验、Draft KV 注入和 anchor 构造。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="token-kv-rails">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 五条同步 token / KV 状态轨</p><h2><code>prefix_lens=[0], extend_lens=[20]</code>：Target 预测 <code>X</code>，但 Draft KV 只拥有本轮输入</h2><p class="section__intro">本例明确假设没有 prefix-cache 命中，因此 positions 是 0–19；存在缓存前缀时应从对应 <code>prefix_lens</code> 起算。“Target 预测了 X”“用户看到了 X”“X 是下一轮 anchor”都不意味着本轮已经写入 <code>K/V(X)</code>。</p></div>
      <div class="visual"><div class="visual__bar"><strong>位置 0–19 的输入，与位置 20 的下一轮锚点</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#prefill-rails">放大辅图</button></div><div class="visual__body canvas-scroll"><div class="rails" id="prefill-rails" role="table" aria-label="Prefill 后 Target 输入、输出、Draft KV 与下一轮锚点">
        <div class="rail-head">状态轨</div><div class="rail-head">位置 0–18</div><div class="rail-head">位置 19</div><div class="rail-head">本轮边界 · 位置 20</div><div class="rail-head">下一轮 · 位置 20</div>
        <div class="rail-label">Target 输入<span>产生 hidden/KV 的真实输入行</span></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="data"><b>p0 … p18</b>prompt 输入</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="data"><b>p19</b>最后一个 prompt 输入</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off"><b>无 X 输入行</b>本轮 forward 到此结束</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="main"><b>X</b>下一轮才作为输入锚点</div>
        <div class="rail-label">Target next-token prediction<span>logits 的语义</span></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">中间位置 logits 不作为本例首 token</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="data"><b>P<sub>T</sub>(· | p0…p19)</b></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="main"><b>sample → X</b>由 p19 行的 next-token logits 产生</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">下一组 logits 尚未计算</div>
        <div class="rail-label">用户可见输出<span>Req.output_ids</span></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">prompt 是用户输入</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">prompt 是用户输入</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="main"><b>[X]</b>prefill 结果处理后成为首个输出 token</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">X 已输出；内部被复用为 anchor</div>
        <div class="rail-label">Draft KV commit<span>由 Target auxiliary hidden 投影</span></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="main"><b>K/V(p0…p18)</b>已写</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="main"><b>K/V(p19)</b>已写</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off"><b>不写 K/V(X)</b>也不清零；该位置逻辑上不可见</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="guard"><b>X 尚无自己的 hidden/KV</b></div>
        <div class="rail-label">下一轮 anchor<span>DFlashDraftInputV2</span></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="off">—</div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="guard"><b>bonus_tokens=[X]</b><br><code>new_seq_lens=[20]</code></div><div class="rail-cell" data-kind="main"><b>Draft 读取 X@20</b>构造 <code>[X,MASK,MASK,MASK]</code></div>
      </div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="why-boundary">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">为什么 / 如果省略 / 功能边界</p><h2>bootstrap 的正确性条件，比“跑一次 Target”更严格</h2></div>
      <div class="failure-grid">
        <article class="callout" data-kind="data"><b>为什么必须在 Target prefill 之后注入？</b><p>只有此时真实 prompt 的 auxiliary hidden、最终位置映射、Target 采样出的首个 token 与 <code>seq_lens</code> 同时可用，Draft 才能从与 Target 对齐的 prefix 状态开始。</p></article>
        <article class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>没有 FULL hidden</b><p><code>logits_output.hidden_states is None</code> 会立即抛 <code>RuntimeError</code>。若忽略它，Draft 缺少 prompt KV，后续 proposal 的上下文错误；这是正确性失败。</p></article>
        <article class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>把 X 提前写入 KV</b><p>本轮 Target 只计算了 prompt 输入行；<code>X</code> 是这些行预测出来的下一个 token，没有对应的 Target auxiliary hidden。伪造 <code>K/V(X)</code> 会把输出侧 token 与输入侧 hidden 错位。</p></article>
        <article class="callout" data-kind="guard"><b>overlap 提前发布与 hidden 清理</b><p><code>on_publish(new_seq_lens)</code> 在 hidden 校验/注入前触发，让 schedule 准备与后续注入重叠；但 worker 仍会校验并完成注入才返回。注入后把 hidden 设为 <code>None</code> 是显存生命周期优化，不会删除已写 Draft KV。</p></article>
      </div>
      <details class="source-details"><summary>源码锚点与关键分支</summary><div class="source-details__body">
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_worker_v2.py:361–432</code><span>extend 分派、DP-idle 边界、Target FULL hidden forward、提前 publish、三组运行时校验、位置计算、KV 注入、hidden 清理与下一轮输入构造。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/tp_worker.py:532–621</code><span><code>TpModelWorker.forward_batch_generation()</code> 从 <code>ScheduleBatch</code> 构造 <code>ForwardBatch</code>，执行 <code>ModelRunner.forward()</code> 并在普通 prefill 路径采样 next token。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/model_executor/model_runner.py:1335–1580</code><span><code>ModelRunner.forward() → _forward_raw()</code> 选择 decode graph、split prefill、prefill graph 或 eager runner；本页只展开 extend 相关三支。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/model_executor/runner/eager_runner.py:252–338</code><span>eager extend 在 <code>needs_forward_metadata_init()</code> 为真时规划 backend metadata，再调用模型前向。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_kv_inject.py:13–78</code><span><code>TargetHiddenKvInjector.inject_target_hidden()</code> 统一输入类型/设备并分派标准 Draft KV 或 MLA/SWA 写入。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_draft.py:158–163</code><span><code>make_next_draft_input()</code> 只接受 <code>bonus_tokens/new_seq_lens</code>，建立明确的跨轮状态边界。</span></div>
